OL,3,GNEWSAPaul Heaton plans another birthday
OL,4,Ahappy hour
OL,5,
OL,6,FPop star Paul Heaton says he is
OL,7,Fplanning on putting money behind the
OL,8,Fbar at dozens of pubs to celebrate his
OL,9,F65th birthday.
OL,11,FThe singer, who fronted Hull-based
OL,12,Fbands The Housemartins and The
OL,13,FBeautiful South, made a similar gesture
OL,14,Fin 2022 when he opened #1,000 tabs at
OL,15,F60 pubs.
OL,17,F"I picked pubs, some of which I knew
OL,18,Fand some I didn't, and put money behind
OL,19,Fthe bar for my birthday. I'll probably
OL,20,Fdo it again next year... 65 is a nice
OL,21,Fnumber," he said.
OL,23,APub: 25-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
